{"shortDescription":"Mike Solana, who runs marketing at Peter Thiel’s Founders Fund and founded Pirate Wires, has disclosed a portfolio concentrated in Palantir Technologies NASDAQ:PLTR, SpaceX NASDAQ:SPCX, Amazon NASDAQ:AMZN and Tesla NASDAQ:TSLA.Palantir Technologies NASDAQ:PLTR accounts for 16.3% of the portfolio, f…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Mike Solana, who runs marketing at Peter Thiel’s Founders Fund and founded Pirate Wires, has disclosed a portfolio concentrated in Palantir Technologies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:PLTR","text":"NASDAQ:PLTR"}},", SpaceX ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SPCX","text":"NASDAQ:SPCX"}},", Amazon ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMZN","text":"NASDAQ:AMZN"}}," and Tesla ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TSLA","text":"NASDAQ:TSLA"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["Palantir Technologies ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:PLTR","text":"NASDAQ:PLTR"}}," accounts for 16.3% of the portfolio, followed by SpaceX ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:SPCX","text":"NASDAQ:SPCX"}}," at 14.1%, Amazon ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMZN","text":"NASDAQ:AMZN"}}," at 14%, and Tesla ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:TSLA","text":"NASDAQ:TSLA"}}," at 13.7%. Together, the four holdings represent 58.1% of the portfolio."]},{"type":"p","children":["Energy-related investments are another major component, with Exxon Mobil ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:XOM","text":"NYSE:XOM"}}," accounting for 7.5%, Cheniere Energy ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:LNG","text":"NYSE:LNG"}}," for 7%, and Constellation Energy ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:CEG","text":"NASDAQ:CEG"}}," for 6.6%. Standard Nuclear ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:STDN","text":"NYSE:STDN"}}," represents a further 6.3%."]},{"type":"p","children":["The portfolio also includes semiconductor stocks, with Advanced Micro Devices ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AMD","text":"NASDAQ:AMD"}}," accounting for 3.2%, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:TSM","text":"NYSE:TSM"}}," and Nvidia ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:NVDA","text":"NASDAQ:NVDA"}}," each representing 2.9%, Broadcom ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:AVGO","text":"NASDAQ:AVGO"}}," at 2.8%, and Micron Technology ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NASDAQ:MU","text":"NASDAQ:MU"}}," at 2.6%."]},{"type":"p","children":["Solana is the founder and editor-in-chief of Pirate Wires, a publication covering technology, politics, and culture, and hosts its podcast. At Founders Fund, he oversees marketing and creative programming, including the firm’s Anatomy of Next podcast and events."]},{"type":"p","children":["The portfolio was also promoted by investing platform Autopilot as the Pirate Wires Flagship Portfolio, with a stated theme of backing companies that “Make America Exceptional.” Autopilot allows users to follow selected portfolios and replicate trades through connected brokerage accounts.",{"type":"disclaimer","children":["Content provided by Seeking Alpha is intended for information purposes only, and that Seeking Alpha does not offer any personalist investment advice and is not a licensed securities dealer, broker, US investment adviser or investment bank."]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Seeking Alpha","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"seekingalpha"}]},{"title":"US stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"US"}]}],"canonical_link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4654992-pirate-wires-founder-mike-solana-bets-big-on-palantir-spacex-tesla-and-amazon?utm_source=tradingview\u0026utm_medium=referral\u0026feed_item_type=news","id":"seekingalpha:9fb4fb17b094b:0","title":"Pirate Wires founder Mike Solana bets big on Palantir, SpaceX, Tesla and Amazon","published":1792566509,"urgency":2,"l